{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720;--card:#0b1220;--muted:#9aa4b2;--accent:#8be4d4;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --radius:12px; --maxw:980px; font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color:#e6eef3;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071019 0%,#08121b 60%);}
    .page{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:48px 20px;}
    header{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#6fd3e6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#07202a}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:14px}
    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

    .hero{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;align-items:start;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}
    .hero .lead{font-size:18px;line-height:1.45;color:#d6eef0}
    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}

    .controls{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .segmented{display:flex;background:var(--glass);padding:6px;border-radius:10px}
    .segmented button{flex:1;background:transparent;border:0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .segmented button.active{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(139,228,212,0.12),rgba(139,228,212,0.06));color:#07202a;font-weight:600}

    .mixer{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .mixer .dot{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#123 0%,#234 100%);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700}
    .recommend{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,18,24,0.35),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)}

    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--accent);outline:none}
    textarea{min-height:90px}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#5fd0d1);color:#042028;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}

    .footer{max-width:var(--maxw);width:100%;margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.logo{width:48px;height:48px}}

    /* subtle svg texture in hero left */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-60px;top:-60px;opacity:0.06;width:420px;height:420px;pointer-events:none}

    .disclaimer{font-size:12px;color:#cbdbe0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:8px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">S</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">A light of stillness for busy days</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="/index.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="/events.html">Calendar</a>
        <a href="/private-sessions.html">Private</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero" role="main">
      <div style="position:relative">
        <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#8be4d4" stop-opacity="0.12"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6fd3e6" stop-opacity="0.06"/></linearGradient>
            <pattern id="p1" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(25)">
              <rect width="10" height="10" fill="url(#g1)"/>
              <circle cx="16" cy="4" r="1.6" fill="#8be4d4" opacity="0.18" />
            </pattern>
          </defs>
          <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" rx="24"/>
        </svg>

        <h1>Contact & Arrangements</h1>
        <p class="lead">A short note, a time to meet — reach out and we’ll shape a listening space that fits your day.
        Use the quick selectors below to describe what you need; the page will suggest a session shape and tune the next-step button.</p>

        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:14px">
          <div class="card">
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">Mood-to-Method</div>
            <div class="controls">
              <div class="segmented" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector" id="moodTabs">
                <button data-mood="raw">Raw</button>
                <button data-mood="tired">Tired</button>
                <button data-mood="open">Open</button>
                <button data-mood="ready">Ready</button>
              </div>

              <div class="recommend" id="moodRecommendation">Choose a mood — we’ll propose the way.</div>

              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Live Session Tone</div>
              <div class="segmented" id="toneSeg">
                <button data-tone="gentle">Gentle</button>
                <button data-tone="medium">Medium</button>
                <button data-tone="intense">Intense</button>
              </div>

              <div class="recommend" id="toneRecommendation">Tone selection shapes instruments and pacing.</div>

              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Home Practice Intensity</div>
              <div class="segmented" id="homeSeg">
                <button data-home="soft">Soft</button>
                <button data-home="balanced">Balanced</button>
                <button data-home="deep">Deep</button>
              </div>

              <div class="recommend" id="homeRecommendation">A home practice suggestion will appear here.</div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <form id="contactForm">
              <label class="meta">Name<input name="name" placeholder="Your name" /></label>
              <label class="meta">Email<input name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" /></label>
              <label class="meta">Phone<input name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}" /></label>

              <label style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Message<textarea name="message" placeholder="What would you like to arrange?"></textarea></label>

              <div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">Quick pick for session type:</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px">
                <button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-pref="collective">Collective Drift</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn ghost" data-pref="intimate">Intimate Focus</button>
              </div>

              <div class="cta-row">
                <button id="primaryCta" class="btn">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
                <button type="button" id="secondaryContact" class="btn ghost">Send message</button>
              </div>

              <div style="margin-top:10px" class="disclaimer">
                Important: Sound sessions are restorative but not medical treatments. If you are pregnant (especially first trimester), have a history of seizures, uncontrolled hypertension, cardiovascular implantable devices, or severe psychiatric conditions, please consult your health provider before attending and note this in your message.
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside style="padding-left:8px">
        <div class="card">
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px">Quick logistics</div>
          <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)">Location</div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>

          <div style="font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)">Next steps</div>
          <ol style="color:var(--muted);padding-left:16px;margin:8px 0">
            <li>Choose mood + tone — see recommended session shape.</li>
            <li>Press the action button to go to booking or pre-fill a request.</li>
            <li>Or send the form message and we’ll reply by email.</li>
          </ol>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="meta">
            <div>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <div class="footer">
      <div>Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      <div style="text-align:right;color:var(--muted)">If you prefer a direct booking, use the primary button. Otherwise send a message and we’ll reply within 48 hours.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method + two sound mixers
    (function(){
      const moodMap = {
        raw: {label:'Stabilize',desc:'Short, grounding sequence — low-frequency bowls, long exhale cues. Ideal when you feel scattered.'},
        tired: {label:'Restore',desc:'Slow layers, breath-aligned belling, gentle vocal overtones to invite ease.'},
        open: {label:'Explore',desc:'Modal flow with inner attention prompts; medium pacing and invited movement.'},
        ready: {label:'Advance',desc:'Focused, slightly dynamic arc for clarity and forward momentum.'}
      };
      const toneMap = {
        gentle:{desc:'Soft mallets, chimes, breath cues. Space for rest.'},
        medium:{desc:'Balanced layering; rhythmic pulses and tonal textures.'},
        intense:{desc:'Deeper overtones, sustained tones, immersive vibrations.'}
      };
      const homeMap = {
        soft:{desc:'5–12 minute micro-practices — recorded guidance available.'},
        balanced:{desc:'15–25 minute routines for daily refresh.'},
        deep:{desc:'Extended sits with deliberate resonance and journaling prompts.'}
      };

      const moodTabs = document.getElementById('moodTabs');
      const toneSeg = document.getElementById('toneSeg');
      const homeSeg = document.getElementById('homeSeg');
      const moodRecommendation = document.getElementById('moodRecommendation');
      const toneRecommendation = document.getElementById('toneRecommendation');
      const homeRecommendation = document.getElementById('homeRecommendation');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');

      function setActive(group, value){
        [...group.querySelectorAll('button')].forEach(b=>{
          b.classList.toggle('active', b.getAttribute('data-' + (group.id==='moodTabs'?'mood':group.id==='toneSeg'?'tone':'home'))===value);
        });
      }

      function updateMood(mood){
        const m = moodMap[mood];
        moodRecommendation.textContent = m.label + ' — ' + m.desc;
        // CTA morphs to match mood
        const ctaText = {
          raw: 'Book a Short Stabilizer',
          tired: 'Reserve a Restful Slot',
          open: 'Schedule an Exploratory Session',
          ready: 'Plan a Clarity Session'
        }[mood] || '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
        primaryCta.textContent = ctaText;
        setActive(moodTabs, mood);
      }

      function updateTone(tone){
        toneRecommendation.textContent = (toneMap[tone]||{desc:''}).desc || 'Tone shapes instrument choice.';
        setActive(toneSeg, tone);
        // small influence on CTA phrasing
        if(tone==='gentle') primaryCta.title = 'Gentle pace suggested';
        if(tone==='intense') primaryCta.title = 'More immersive session suggested';
      }

      function updateHome(home){
        homeRecommendation.textContent = (homeMap[home]||{desc:''}).desc;
        setActive(homeSeg, home);
      }

      moodTabs.addEventListener('click', e=>{
        if(e.target.matches('button')){
          const m = e.target.getAttribute('data-mood');
          updateMood(m);
        }
      });
      toneSeg.addEventListener('click', e=>{
        if(e.target.matches('button')){
          updateTone(e.target.getAttribute('data-tone'));
        }
      });
      homeSeg.addEventListener('click', e=>{
        if(e.target.matches('button')){
          updateHome(e.target.getAttribute('data-home'));
        }
      });

      // Quick pref buttons pre-fill message and adjust UI
      document.querySelectorAll('button[data-pref]').forEach(b=>{
        b.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
          const pref = b.getAttribute('data-pref');
          const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
          const msg = form.querySelector('textarea');
          if(pref==='collective'){
            msg.value = 'I am interested in a Collective Drift — group gathering for 45–60 mins. Please share next available dates.';
            updateMood('open'); updateTone('medium'); updateHome('balanced');
          } else {
            msg.value = 'I am interested in an Intimate Focus — 1:1 session for concentrated themes. Please advise availability.';
            updateMood('ready'); updateTone('gentle'); updateHome('soft');
          }
        });
      });

      // Primary CTA leads to booking page (placeholder URL injection can be server-side)
      primaryCta.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        // The CTA label morphs; send user to booking with query params of selections
        const mood = [...moodTabs.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b=>b.classList.contains('active'))?.getAttribute('data-mood')||'';
        const tone = [...toneSeg.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b=>b.classList.contains('active'))?.getAttribute('data-tone')||'';
        const home = [...homeSeg.querySelectorAll('button')].find(b=>b.classList.contains('active'))?.getAttribute('data-home')||'';
        const url = new URL('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}', location.origin);
        if(mood) url.searchParams.set('mood', mood);
        if(tone) url.searchParams.set('tone', tone);
        if(home) url.searchParams.set('home', home);
        // Navigate
        window.location.href = url.toString();
      });

      // Secondary contact sends an in-page mock submission (no backend)
      document.getElementById('secondaryContact').addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
        const data = {
          name: form.name.value || '',
          email: form.email.value || '',
          phone: form.phone.value || '',
          message: form.message.value || ''
        };
        // show a gentle confirmation
        const prev = document.getElementById('sentNote'); if(prev) prev.remove();
        const note = document.createElement('div'); note.id='sentNote'; note.className='disclaimer'; note.style.marginTop='8px';
        note.textContent = 'Thanks — your message is ready. We will reply to ' + (data.email || 'the address you provided') + ' within 48 hours.';
        form.appendChild(note);
      });

      // Initialize default states
      updateMood('tired'); updateTone('gentle'); updateHome('balanced');

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for sound_bath (slug: sound_bath-MORE-2026-02-17T09-57-34-583Z-010)

What these files are

- contact.html — interactive contact / scheduling surface exposing the Mood-to-Method selector and two Sound Preference mixers. The page is designed to be self-contained: CSS + JS inline, no external assets required. Placeholders in the file need replacement in production: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

How the interactive pieces work (local JS only)

1) Mood-to-Method selector
- Located in the left card as a segmented control (tabs). Options: Raw, Tired, Open, Ready.
- Choosing a mood updates the recommendation copy immediately and changes the primary CTA label to a context-aware action (e.g., "Reserve a Restful Slot").
- The CTA, when clicked, navigates to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} with query parameters describing current selections: mood, tone, home. Example: {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=raw&tone=gentle&home=soft

2) Live Session Tone mixer
- Segmented control (Gentle / Medium / Intense). Selecting a tone updates the small tone recommendation area and adds subtle influence to the CTA (via title text).

3) Home Practice Intensity mixer
- Separate segmented control (Soft / Balanced / Deep). Selecting updates the home practice suggestion box.

4) Two quick-pref buttons
- "Collective Drift" and "Intimate Focus" pre-fill the message textarea and set mood/tone/home combinations to sensible defaults.

Form behavior
- The contact form is a front-end mock: clicking "Send message" will not perform network calls; instead it shows an in-page confirmation. The primary CTA redirects to the booking URL with query params as noted above.

Accessibility & UX notes
- Controls are simple buttons styled as segmented controls for keyboard accessibility.
- Color contrast is tuned for dark backgrounds; primary accent variables are at the top of the stylesheet for easy changes.
- A clear contraindications disclaimer is included near the form as required for responsible sound offerings.

Files included in this chunk
- contact.html
- README.md (this file)

Integration notes
- This project uses server-side replacement for placeholders. Make sure to substitute the placeholders with real values when deploying.
- The page references no external fonts or images. A decorative inline SVG texture is included inside the hero to provide visual interest without external assets. If you want a separate asset at assets/img/pattern.svg, replace or add an external file in another chunk; the inline SVG here is sufficient if no asset is provided.

Testing
- Open contact.html in a browser. Click mood/tone/home buttons and observe the recommendation areas and CTA text.
- Click the primary CTA to confirm navigation to the booking URL with query parameters. (In a local file context, the URL will be resolved relative to file origin.)
- Use the quick-pref buttons and click "Send message" to see the inline confirmation appear.

Design decisions & constraints
- Minimal, poetic voice in UI copy while keeping clear affordances for booking and contact.
- Unique labels for navigation to avoid reuse of common phrasing across templates.
- Two separate mixers satisfy the requirement for multiple intensity controls that influence program recommendations.

Contraindications reminder
- The contact form includes responsible guidance: attendees with pregnancy (early trimester), seizure history, cardiac devices, or certain psychiatric conditions should consult a provider and disclose during booking. This is informational and not medical advice.

If you need additional pages for this build (index, events, pricing, etc.), those are separate chunks. Replace placeholders in all pages before publishing."}
